{"header":{"type":"esummary","version":"0.3"},"result":{"uids":["200130715"],"200130715":{"uid":"200130715","accession":"GSE130715","gds":"","title":"Budesonide induced transcriptional activity in control and Gs-knockdown human airway smooth muscle cells","summary":"Budesonide alter cell function through gene expression changes that occur via activation of ubiquitously expressed intracellular glucocorticoid receptors. However, a number of recent studies suggest that budesonide also activate rapid alterations in various signaling processes that appear to be non-genomic in nature, and likely dependent on Gs. Here, we investigate the Gs dependent non-genomic transcriptional activity due to 24 hours of budesonide treatment.","gpl":"20301","gse":"130715","taxon":"Homo sapiens","entrytype":"GSE","gdstype":"Expression profiling by high throughput sequencing","ptechtype":"","valtype":"","ssinfo":"","subsetinfo":"","pdat":"2020/01/08","suppfile":"TXT","samples":[{"accession":"GSM3752388","title":"Patient 5-budesonide treated [4R117-P18-GTGAAA]"},{"accession":"GSM3752382","title":"Patient 3-Gs-knockdown budesonide treated [4R117-P12-CTTGTA]"},{"accession":"GSM3752385","title":"Patient 4-Gs-knockdown [4R117-P15-ATGTCA]"},{"accession":"GSM3752391","title":"Patient 6-control [4R117-P21-CGTACG]"},{"accession":"GSM3752371","title":"Patient 1-control [4R117-P01-ATCACG]"},{"accession":"GSM3752374","title":"Patient 1-Gs-knockdown budesonide treated [4R117-P04-TGACCA]"},{"accession":"GSM3752394","title":"Patient 6-Gs-knockdown budesonide treated [4R117-P24-ATTCCT]"},{"accession":"GSM3752380","title":"Patient 3-budesonide treated [4R117-P10-TAGCTT]"},{"accession":"GSM3752383","title":"Patient 4-control [4R117-P13-AGTCAA]"},{"accession":"GSM3752377","title":"Patient 2-Gs-knockdown [4R117-P07-CAGATC]"},{"accession":"GSM3752389","title":"Patient 5-Gs-knockdown [4R117-P19-GTGGCC]"},{"accession":"GSM3752378","title":"Patient 2-Gs-knockdown budesonide treated [4R117-P08-ACTTGA]"},{"accession